{"id":"2cf611da381080e0","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization.md","title":"Arithmetic Realizations Using a Chosen Provability Formula","display":"df-modal-arithmetic-realization — Arithmetic Realizations Using a Chosen Provability Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization","aliases":["92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization"],"display":"df-modal-arithmetic-realization — Arithmetic Realizations Using a Chosen Provability Formula","source":"第 XI 章 pp. 133–134；第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 150–151、123–124）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-modal-language]]","[[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]","[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-arithmetic-realization — Arithmetic Realizations Using a Chosen Provability Formula"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 pp. 133–134；第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 150–151、123–124）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c908091e8e31a3b\" href=\"?note=4c908091e8e31a3b\" title=\"92-df-modal-language\">92-df-modal-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd6b982556489ede\" href=\"?note=bd6b982556489ede\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution\">92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e05c7a445ae4a4cd\" href=\"?note=e05c7a445ae4a4cd\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering\">92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A\">\\(U\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_E(U)\\subseteq\\{v_1^E\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_E(U)\\subseteq\\{v_1^E\\}\\)</span> 为所选可证性基公式；不假定它自动满足 HBL。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_A\">\\(\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_E\">\\(g_E\\)</span> 为原书编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nf}_{E,1,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{nf}_{E,1,n}\\)</span> 为数码实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha_\\rho^U&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\\\\n\\alpha_\\rho^U(p_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(p_i),&amp;\n\\alpha_\\rho^U(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\nu_0^E=\\nu_1^E),\\\\\n\\alpha_\\rho^U(F\\supset H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha_\\rho^U(F)\\supset\\alpha_\\rho^U(H),&amp;\n\\alpha_\\rho^U(\\Box F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nf}_{E,1,g_E(\\alpha_\\rho^U(F))}(U).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha_\\rho^U&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\\\\n\\alpha_\\rho^U(p_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(p_i),&amp;\n\\alpha_\\rho^U(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\nu_0^E=\\nu_1^E),\\\\\n\\alpha_\\rho^U(F\\supset H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha_\\rho^U(F)\\supset\\alpha_\\rho^U(H),&amp;\n\\alpha_\\rho^U(\\Box F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nf}_{E,1,g_E(\\alpha_\\rho^U(F))}(U).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Box 分支先翻译为算术句子，取该句子的原书码，再用这个数的数码代入 U。不能给 U 传原模态字符串，也不能把外部自然数直接当对象语言项。</p>\n<p>有限树递归给唯一翻译且输出闭句。所选 U 的 P1–P3 和正确性是独立条件；本构造不证明它们。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-modal-language","status":"resolved","id":"4c908091e8e31a3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"bd6b982556489ede","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e05c7a445ae4a4cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_E(U)\\subseteq\\{v_1^E\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_A","display":false},{"tex":"g_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nf}_{E,1,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha_\\rho^U&:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\\\\n\\alpha_\\rho^U(p_i)&\\coloneqq\\rho(p_i),&\n\\alpha_\\rho^U(\\bot)&\\coloneqq(\\nu_0^E=\\nu_1^E),\\\\\n\\alpha_\\rho^U(F\\supset H)&\\coloneqq\\alpha_\\rho^U(F)\\supset\\alpha_\\rho^U(H),&\n\\alpha_\\rho^U(\\Box F)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nf}_{E,1,g_E(\\alpha_\\rho^U(F))}(U).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1660,"backlinks":[{"id":"bf4e24a615d3695e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]、[[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness]]"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-abstract-translation]] → [[92-thm-modal-translation-soundness]]；[[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness]]。"},{"id":"71962c0a446ff8b2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$；$\\alpha_\\rho^{U_{\\mathrm{PA}}}$ 见 [[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]]"}],"outgoing":["4c908091e8e31a3b","bd6b982556489ede","e05c7a445ae4a4cd"]}